      "content": "Is there a system of values of the relative nuclear coordinates $\\xi_i$ such that the eigenfunctions $\\psi_n$ of the energy operator (6), in so far as they depend on the $\\xi_i$, have values significantly different from zero only in a small neighbourhood of this set?",
